  "description": "Single storey side and rear extensions linking to outbuilding including new roof with glazed lantern; installation of extraction system; external alterations",
  "development_type": "Minor retail and service",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;Insufficient information has been submitted to demonstrate that the proposed development would mitigate the impact of surface water flooding contrary to Policies SI 12 and SI 13 of the London Plan (2021) and CN3 and CN4 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed external extractor fan, by reasons of its location next to the first floor ancillary accommodation on site and insufficient details have been submitted to demonstrate that the proposed external equipment would have no adverse noise, &lt;span class=&quot;scayt-misspell-word&quot; data-scayt-word=&quot;odour&quot; data-wsc-lang=&quot;en_US&quot; data-wsc-id=&quot;mnfzj58exsa7u20wm&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;odour&lt;/span&gt; or nuisance impacts for the &lt;span class=&quot;scayt-misspell-word&quot; data-scayt-word=&quot;neighbouring&quot; data-wsc-lang=&quot;en_US&quot; data-wsc-id=&quot;mnfzj58dgzkl05x41&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;neighbouring&lt;/span&gt; occupants at the first floor ancillary accommodation of the site,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;scayt-misspell-word&quot; data-scayt-word=&quot;L’Escargot&quot; data-wsc-lang=&quot;en_US&quot; data-wsc-id=&quot;mnfzj58dttmjb9nqc&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;L’Escargot&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Camden Row and 3 &lt;span class=&quot;scayt-misspell-word&quot; data-scayt-word=&quot;Rickmansworth&quot; data-wsc-lang=&quot;en_US&quot; data-wsc-id=&quot;mnfzj58dmgw8dhwg7&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Rickmansworth&lt;/span&gt; Road, would lead to an adverse&amp;nbsp;noise, &lt;span class=&quot;scayt-misspell-word&quot; data-scayt-word=&quot;odour&quot; data-wsc-lang=&quot;en_US&quot; data-wsc-id=&quot;mnfzj58d4381c954g&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;odour&lt;/span&gt; and nuisance impacts for the &lt;span class=&quot;scayt-misspell-word&quot; data-scayt-word=&quot;neighbouring&quot; data-wsc-lang=&quot;en_US&quot; data-wsc-id=&quot;mnfzj58cpesyo3kpu&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;neighbouring&lt;/span&gt; properties and that of the amenities of the first floor ancillary accommodation on the site. In light of the above, the proposed development would be contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), policies D3 and D14 of the London Plan (2021) and&amp;nbsp;policy GR1 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
